      "sources": [
        {
          "source_id": "7cfr-273.10",
          "citation": "7 CFR 273.10(e)(2)(ii)(A)",
          "quote": "the household's monthly allotment shall be equal to the maximum SNAP allotment for the household's size reduced by 30 percent of the household's net monthly income"
        }
      ],
      "interpretation": {
        "status": "needs_review",
        "note": "Guarded on eligibility, so an ineligible household receives no allotment determination rather than a zero. Initial-month proration and the $10 initial-month rule at (e)(2)(ii)(B) are out of v0.1 scope. The minimum benefit is itself at or above zero, so the substitution needs no separate zero floor; the redundant one was removed after mutation testing showed it could never change a result."
      }
